    ],
    "quest.workshop_oaths.temper_and_tally.stage.heat_stock.scene.start_quest.action.start.lines.started": [
      "带8个铁锭和12个煤炭。在锤子升起之前，好的工作就开始了。"
    ],
    "quest.workshop_oaths.temper_and_tally.stage.heat_stock.scene.start_quest.action.start.lines.unavailable": [
      "熔炉现在还没有准备好寻求帮助。"
    ],
    "quest.workshop_oaths.temper_and_tally.stage.heat_stock.ui.tracker_text": "带8个铁锭和12个煤炭。",
    "quest.workshop_oaths.temper_and_tally.stage.return.dialogue.turn_in.label": "关于淬炼",
    "quest.workshop_oaths.temper_and_tally.stage.return.dialogue.turn_in.lines": [
      "熨烫、加热和清洁表面。那是一个可以脸红地做出承诺的工坊。"
    ],
    "quest.workshop_oaths.temper_and_tally.stage.return.dialogue.turn_in.response.complete.label": "关闭锻造记录。",
    "quest.workshop_oaths.temper_and_tally.stage.return.dialogue.turn_in.response.leave.label": "还没有。",
    "quest.workshop_oaths.temper_and_tally.stage.return.scene.complete_quest.action.turn_in.lines.completed": [
      "好的。用这种材料制成的工具失败的声音应该较小。理想情况下，根本不会。"
    ],
    "quest.workshop_oaths.temper_and_tally.stage.return.scene.complete_quest.action.turn_in.lines.missing_objectives": [
      "在我关闭锻造台之前，它仍然需要铁、煤或磨石。"
    ],
    "quest.workshop_oaths.temper_and_tally.stage.return.scene.complete_quest.action.turn_in.lines.missing_proof": [
